{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05492","headline":"使至三姓咽面 · 张宣明","name":"使至三姓咽面","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔闻班家子，笔砚忽然投。\n一朝抚长劒，万里入荒陬。\n岂不服艰险，只思清国讐。\n山川去何岁，霜露几逢秋。\n玉塞已遐廓，铁关方阻修。\n东都日窅窅，西海此悠悠。\n卒使功名建，长封万里侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张宣明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}